n| Verifier | `code/planning/plan_verifier.py` | Re-simulation assertions |\n| Explanation Gen | `code/output/explanation_generator.py` | LLM/template |\n\n---\n\n## C. Data Flow\n\n```\nCSV files \n<truncated 1926 bytes>\ngainst all 25 sample installment plans |\n| max_installment_months span calculation | 🟡 Medium | Use calendar month delta, not integer division |\n| Pending debit omission | 🟡 Medium | Always reserve before binary search |\n| Inter-account transfer double-counting | 🟡 Medium | Detect via bank message pattern |\n| Float rounding errors | 🟢 Low | Use `decimal.Decimal` throughout |\n\n---\n\n## F. Test Strategy\n\n1. **Unit tests** for each module (event resolver, currency normaliser, instalment schedule generator)\n2. **Integration test** on all 25 sample requests → compare every field\n3. **Assertion layer** validates all hard constraints on every output row before writing\n4. **Regression check** on 6 key sample rows after any change\n\n---\n\n## G. Recommended Technology Stack\n\n| Concern | Choice |\n|---|---|\n| Language | Python 3.11+ |\n| CSV processing | `pandas` (events), `csv` (small files) |\n| Financial arithmetic | `decimal.Decimal` |\n| OCR / multimodal | Google Gemini 1.5 Flash (vision) |\n| Explanation LLM | Google Gemini 1.5 Flash (text) |\n| Date arithmetic | `datetime` stdlib |\n| Environment config | `python-dotenv` |\n| Packaging | `zipfile` stdlib |\n\n---\n\n## Created Documents\n\n- [`docs/architecture.md`](file:///d:/HACKATHON/hackerrank-orchestrate-september26-main/docs/architecture.md)\n- [`docs/data_model.md`](file:///d:/HACKATHON/hackerrank-orchestrate-september26-main/docs/data_model.md)\n- [`docs/decision_engine.md`](file:///d:/HACKATHON/hackerrank-orchestrate-september26-main/docs/decision_engine.md)\n- [`docs/edge_cases.md`](file:///d:/HACKATHON/hackerrank-orchestrate-september26-main/docs/edge_cases.md)\n- [`docs/evaluation_strategy.md`](file:///d:/HACKATHON/hackerrank-orchestrate-september26-main/docs/evaluation_st