\n```text\\n               +-------------------------------------------------------------+\\n               |                  Dataset Layer (CSVs & Media)               |\\n               | requests | profiles | events | FX | options | msgs | imag\n<truncated 20884 bytes>","Cwd":"\"d:\\\\HACKATHON\\\\hackerrank-orchestrate-september26-main\"","IsDaemon":"false","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"5000","toolAction":"\"Writing comprehensive README.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Update README.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
