ner ([`src/ui/templates/index.html`](file:///d:/HACKATHON/hackerrank-orchestrate-september26-main/src/ui/templates/index.html)):**\n   - Added `#devWarningBanner` above the dashboard grid.\n   - In `renderDashboard(data)`, wired display logic:\n     ```javascript\n     const warnBanner = document.getElementById('devWarningBanner');\n     const warnMsg = document.getElementById('devWarningMessage');\n     const warningText = data.warning || (dec && dec.warning);\n     if (warningText) {\n       warnMsg.textContent = warningText;\n       warnBanner.style.display = 'block';\n     } else {\n       warnBanner.style.display = 'none';\n     }\n     ```\n\n3. **UI Demo Regression Test Suite ([`tests/test_ui_demo_regression.py`](file:///d:/HACKATHON/hackerrank-orchestrate-september26-main/tests/test_ui_demo_regression.py)):**\n   - `test_api_requests_dynamic_source_of_truth`: Verifies that `/api/requests` returns demo requests whose attributes strictly match direct invocations of [`make_decision()`](file:///d:/HACKATHON/hackerrank-orchestrate-september26-main/src/affordability/engine.py).\n   - `test_api_analyze_matches_engine_authoritative`: Verifies that `/api/analyze/<id>` matches the engine across all 7 demos for status, badges, payment methods, plans, and spending changes.\n   - `test_engine_never_overridden_by_expected_label`: Verifies adversarial behavior where legacy labels disagree with the engine (e.g. `request_01`), confirming the engine result is displayed and the development warning is produced.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Results\n\n- **UI Regression Suite**:\n  ```bash\n  pytest tests/test_ui_demo_regression.py -v\n  # 3 passed in 0.95s\n  ```\n- **Full Test Suite**:\n  ```bash\n  pytest -q\n  # 104 passed in 1.48s\n  ```\n- **Full Production Pipeline**:\n  ```bash\n  python run.py\n  # PIPELINE EXECUTION COMPLETED SUCCESSFULLY IN 2.836s (0 validation errors)\n  ```\n- **Submission Staging & Artifacts**:\n  - Synchronized updated UI modules, templates, and test