lete the request by `desired_completion_date` and keep the user above their minimum balance throughout the 90-day forecast.\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
